1
00:00:00,644 --> 00:00:02,274
(Penny:)No, I know.

2
00:00:02,563 --> 00:00:05,603
(Penny:)I know what you meant.
It's just this is only our first date.

3
00:00:05,775 --> 00:00:06,815
(Leonard:)Okay. Sure. No problem.

4
00:00:06,984 --> 00:00:09,274
(Leonard:)Why don't we just figure out
where we're going...

5
00:00:09,445 --> 00:00:11,575
...and when we want to get there?

6
00:00:11,739 --> 00:00:15,619
(Leonard:)And then rate of speed
equals distance over time.

7
00:00:17,536 --> 00:00:19,456
(Leonard:)Solve for R.

8
00:00:20,539 --> 00:00:22,119
(Penny:)Or we could just wing it.

9
00:00:23,167 --> 00:00:25,127
(Leonard:)That might work too.

10
00:00:25,753 --> 00:00:27,833
- Good night, Leonard.
- Good night.

11
00:00:32,927 --> 00:00:34,757
(Raj:)He's coming. Screen saver.

12
00:00:39,391 --> 00:00:41,391
(Howard:)Oh, hey, Leonard.

13
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:44,190
(Howard:)- How was your date?
- Bite me.

14
00:00:46,357 --> 00:00:49,857
(Leonard:)Sheldon, how could you just sit there
and let them spy on me?

15
00:00:50,027 --> 00:00:51,067
(Sheldon:)They were clever.

16
00:00:51,237 --> 00:00:54,617
(Sheldon:)They exploited my complete lack of interest
in what you were doing.

17
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,910
(Howard:)You should thank us.
When future generations try to determine...

18
00:00:59,078 --> 00:01:01,708
(Howard:)...why your relationship with Penny
crashed and burned...

